    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the popular village of Fenagh, this well-maintained 3-bedroom bungalow offers comfortable and spacious living in a convenient location. The property provides bright and airy accommodation throughout, making it an ideal home for families, couples, or  seeking a peaceful lifestyle with local amenities close at hand.\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen with dining room, three generously sized bedrooms, and a family bathroom and additional lavatory. The bungalow benefits from oil-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, and ample storage space. Large garage with separate laundry area.\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a private mature garden with plenty of outdoor space. Its village location offers easy access to local primary school, coffee shop, community facilities, and transport links, while still enjoying the tranquillity of rural living. No Pets Allowed. Online Application Only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
